00EFB4  2               
00EFB4  2               ; parse 16-bit XRAM offset into FIO flat-address registers
00EFB4  2               ; BASIC supplies the high byte through current XBANK.
00EFB4  2               
00EFB4  2               LAB_XFIO_SETOFF
00EFB4  2  20 9C D8           JSR   LAB_GTWRD
00EFB7  2  A5 AF              LDA   FAC1_3
